        {
            "title": "滬指收跌10點 深指挫0.71% 兩市成交降至剛逾1.3萬億",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內地A股午市再現臨尾低位反彈戲碼，將滬深兩市股指跌幅又一次大幅收窄，交投則進一步縮減至1.305萬億元(人民幣‧下同)。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20240307_FI_source-ap_AShare-9.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20240307_FI_source-ap_AShare-9.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">上證綜指低開4點後跌幅迅速擴大，開市僅約3分鐘已跌逾20點，早市中段一度跌至3,547點，挫39點或1.11%，成為全日低位，於早市尾段跌幅明顯收窄，午後繼續反覆，後段跌幅曾擴大至約1%，收市前20分鐘重現低位抽上的情況；滬指最後收報3,577點，僅跌10點0.28%，成交6,369.09億元。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深證成指相對跑輸，早市中段最低報10,505點，跌153點或1.44%，成為全日低位，中午收市前跌勢收斂，午後初段乘勢再上並短暫倒升，最高見10,664點，升4點，未幾反覆再跌，最後20分鐘跌幅卻由約1.3%大幅收窄；深指最後收報10,583點，跌76點或0.714%，成交6,682.38億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300指數更倒升1點或0.03%，以3,984點收市；創業板指數跌18點或0.79%，報2,293點。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"華虹官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/01347-2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"華虹官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/01347-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">華虹官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">不少板塊內股份走勢分歧，華虹宏力(01347)A股(688347.SH)與中芯國際(00981)A股(688981.SH)持續強勢，華虹宏力A股收漲8.05%，報199.86元；中芯A股升幅擴大至6.21%，報122.25元；AI芯片概念股寒武紀(688256.SH)則跌1.58%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17216545-%e6%bb%ac%e6%8c%87%e6%94%b6%e8%b7%8c10%e9%bb%9e-%e6%b7%b1%e6%8c%87%e6%8c%ab0-71-%e5%85%a9%e5%b8%82%e6%88%90%e4%ba%a4%e9%99%8d%e8%87%b3%e5%89%9b%e9%80%be1-3%e8%90%ac%e5%84%84",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250408_FI_source-ap_AShare-2.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 15:23:37",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "港股午後跌521點   聯想挫7.6%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股恒生指數跌幅擴大至500點以上，現跌520點或2.24%，報22,773點，最低見22772點。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：聯想官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/20230905_FI_00992_Lenovo_SOURCE-WEB.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：聯想官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/20230905_FI_00992_Lenovo_SOURCE-WEB.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：聯想官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數跌102點或2.73%，報3,634點 ; 恒生國企指數跌2.13%或166點，報7,669。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交1,767.32億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">聯想(00992)績後捱沽，跌7.56%，為表現最差藍籌股 ; 華虹宏力(01347)升8.2%，為表現最佳藍籌股。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">騰訊(00700)跌6.97%，報346.8元，推低恒指120點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國產GPU概念急插，天數智芯(09903)狂瀉21.33%，報56.8元 ; 壁仞科技(06082) 挫5.36%，報21.18元。</p>\n</div>",
