        {
            "title": "台金管會推跌市後限制沽空措施 明日起生效",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">因應近期台股屢現單日急跌，台灣金管會剛公布加強沽空限制措施，由明日(11月20日)起生效。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230704_FI_source-licensed_TaiwanStock_FB.jpg.webp\">\n<img src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230704_FI_source-licensed_TaiwanStock_FB.jpg.webp\"/>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">新措施規定，若當日收盤價跌幅達3.5%以上，下個交易日不得低於上日收盤價放空；但次交易日收盤價跌幅仍達3.5%以上，將持續進行價格限制措施。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">另外，將調整每日盤中借券賣出委託數量，由原本不超過相關證券前30個營業日的日均成交量的3%，降低至1%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">台金管會又鼓勵金融業買入具有投資會值的績優股票，鼓勵證券自營商履行造市義務，並鼓勵上市櫃公司適時實施庫藏股制度。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17216037-%e5%8f%b0%e9%87%91%e7%ae%a1%e6%9c%83%e6%8e%a8%e8%b7%8c%e5%b8%82%e5%be%8c%e9%99%90%e5%88%b6%e6%b2%bd%e7%a9%ba%e6%8e%aa%e6%96%bd-%e6%98%8e%e6%97%a5%e8%b5%b7%e7%94%9f%e6%95%88",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230704_FI_source-licensed_TaiwanStock.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 14:34:33",
